# 01. Purpose

This document establishes how AEGIS proves that its implementation matches its approved architecture.

It connects:

```text
Stakeholder Need
        ↓
System Objective
        ↓
Requirement
        ↓
User Journey
        ↓
Screen
        ↓
Domain Model
        ↓
State
        ↓
Data Contract
        ↓
API / Service
        ↓
UI Component
        ↓
Security Control
        ↓
AI Capability
        ↓
Telemetry
        ↓
