```

---

## Level 3 — System

Does it work with the rest of AEGIS?

```text
screen
+
state
+
API
+
domain
```

---

## Level 4 — Operational

Does the complete workflow work?

```text
detection
→ investigation
→ decision
→ response
→ feedback
```

---

## Level 5 — Stakeholder

Does it work for the intended users?

```text
understandable
credible
useful
trustworthy
