# 57. Verification Debt

Verification debt occurs when:

```text
feature implemented
but
evidence missing
```

This must be tracked separately from technical debt.

Example:

```text
Feature: Threat Classification
Implementation: COMPLETE
Tests: PARTIAL
Stakeholder validation: NOT STARTED
Status: AMBER
```

---

# 58. Technical Debt vs Verification Debt

### Technical Debt

The implementation needs improvement.

### Verification Debt

The team does not yet have enough evidence that the implementation is correct.

Both matter.

In AEGIS:

> **Unverified critical behavior must be treated as incomplete behavior.**

