7. Every API must have a consumer and business purpose.

8. Every major domain entity must have a requirement.

9. Every critical requirement must have a test.

10. Every critical risk must have a control.

11. Every critical workflow must be observable.

12. Every consequential AI capability must remain bounded and auditable.

13. Every architectural change must be recorded.

14. Ambiguity must be surfaced, not invented away.

15. Mock behavior must never be confused with production capability.

16. Stakeholder validation is part of system verification.

17. The 13 screens are one system, not thirteen independent products.

18. The operational journey is more important than visual completeness.

19. Evidence beats assumption.

20. Traceability beats memory.
